 involves supervising, guiding, motivating, and leading people towards the attainment of planned targets? ","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Organizing "},{"label":"B","text":"Planning "},{"label":"C","text":"Directing "},{"label":"D","text":"Controlling "}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-5b53cf7187f1","stem":"What is the purpose of a Gantt chart? ","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"To list all actions/steps needed for a project, along with deadlines and responsible individuals "},{"label":"B","text":"To establish lines of communication "},{"label":"C","text":"To clarify the process of attaining desired goals "},{"label":"D","text":"To visualize tasks, their start dates, duration, and dependencies "}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-b62babbf1e51","stem":"Who stated that leadership is \"the ability of a superior to influence the behaviors of his subordinates and persuade them to follow a particular course of action\"? •","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned 